OL,3,AWeekend showers and sunshine for UK
OL,4,Aahead of warmer air next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will be a weekend of two halves
OL,7,Fweather-wise for most people with many
OL,8,Fseeing a cool start on Saturday.
OL,10,FA strengthening north-westerly wind
OL,11,Fwill carry showers across the UK. But
OL,12,FSunday looks calmer with sunshine in
OL,13,Fthe north and east and rain creeping
OL,14,Finto the south and west.
OL,16,FLooking further ahead, next week will
OL,17,Fsee a return to above average
OL,18,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
