OL,3,AWeekend showers and sunshine for UK
OL,4,Aahead of warmer air next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FTuesday looks set to be the warmest day
OL,7,Fof the period and could reach 21C for
OL,8,Fsome. However a deep area of low
OL,9,Fpressure is likely to bring some stormy
OL,10,Fweather across the north.
